{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03999","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 长孙正隐","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晦晚属烟霞，遨游重岁华。\n歌钟虽戚里，林薮是山家。\n细雨犹开日，深池不涨沙。\n淹留迷处所，岩岫几重花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙正隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}